 "_doc": "Chomp Frog (z1_t1), body type 2 squat stomper. Cube indices (integers); a cube i occupies [i*cube, (i+1)*cube] studs. x = left/right (centred: -8..7), y = depth (front = -y, centred: -5..4), z = up (feet z=0). Fills are painted in order, later fills win. box = [x0,y0,z0,x1,y1,z1] half-open. ball = [cx,cy,cz,r] over cube-centre distance. cyl = [axis,c1,c2,r,lo,hi]: cubes lo..hi-1 along axis within r of the line at (c1,c2) on the other two axes. seg = [x0,y0,z0,x1,y1,z1,r]: cubes within r of a segment (flat ends). colour = list of palette names; the cube picks one by a fixed hash, so repeats weight the scatter. mirror=true paints the same fill again at x -> -x-1 (colour hash taken from the mirrored cube). Colours are sampled from team/pack/concepts/brick-brawl/creatures.png. M1-03b (2026-11-25): rebuilt to the picture: domed head with a V brow, nostrils, forward jaw wedge, splayed legs and toed feet, round fists with a wrist cuff.",
